  "en": {
   "tiny": {
    "Hi, I'm Tiny! Want to hear a joke?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/tiny-hello-ebe67c3a.m4a",
     "s": 3.1
    },
    "What do you call a sleeping dinosaur? A dino-snore!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/tiny-joke-8321a5ad.m4a",
     "s": 5.85
    },
    "Lovely drawing! Just like my paintings.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/tiny-cheer-ed781ffb.m4a",
     "s": 3.57
    },
    "Why does Giganto stomp so loudly? He can't tiptoe!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/tiny-line2-d70c7f1b.m4a",
     "s": 4.68
    },
    "I may be Tiny, but I'm the strongest of us all!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/tiny-line3-85b32020.m4a",
     "s": 3.85
    },
    "A joke for the road? Okay, later. Now we draw!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/tiny-cheer2-c83ce771.m4a",
     "s": 4.22
    },
    "Flower, where are you? I want to paint you!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-tiny-flower-40732071.m4a",
     "s": 3.65
    },
    "Shall we play a shell song? First we need a shell!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-tiny-shell-f283f667.m4a",
     "s": 3.68
    },
    "A picnic without berries? Oh no! Will you help?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-tiny-berries-cbe15201.m4a",
     "s": 4.72
    },
    "My paintbrush fell apart! Can you find a feather?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-tiny-feather-a0708eb9.m4a",
     "s": 3.6
    }
   },
   "rocky": {
    "Hi, I'm Rocky! The fastest dino in the jungle!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/rocky-hello-603b1f69.m4a",
     "s": 3.7
    },
    "I'm a parasaur… a paralo… I'm a dino with a trumpet!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/rocky-species-281023db.m4a",
     "s": 5.75
    },
    "You draw, I toot. Toot! That one's for you!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/rocky-cheer-03c83877.m4a",
     "s": 3.63
    },
    "I've got a trumpet on my head. Toot, toot!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/rocky-line2-fcbbde16.m4a",
     "s": 2.88
    },
    "One day I'll high-five Giganto. You'll see!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/rocky-line3-0da7669c.m4a",
     "s": 3.35
    },
    "I'd be off running already! But you do it your way.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/rocky-cheer2-cf0adfde.m4a",
     "s": 3.46
    },
    "The biggest nut in the jungle! We'll set a record!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-rocky-nut-324f9888.m4a",
     "s": 3.59
    },
    "Quick, quick! Where's that flower?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-rocky-flower-b8e4a0df.m4a",
     "s": 2.14
    },
    "A shiny stone for Giganto! He'll be so happy!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-rocky-stone-28d801af.m4a",
     "s": 3.83
    },
    "With a feather I'll fly for sure! Well… maybe a bit.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-rocky-feather-d7332a31.m4a",
     "s": 4.84
    }
   },
   "bill": {
    "Hi, I'm Bill! Got anything to eat?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/bill-hello-50b56d6f.m4a",
     "s": 2.75
    },
    "I've got the best nose in the jungle. I can sniff out any fruit!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/bill-line1-4711f99f.m4a",
     "s": 4.45
    },
    "Even dragonflies scare me. But I feel braver with you.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/bill-line2-cb3d1cbb.m4a",
     "s": 4.17
    },
    "I always sing when I cook. La la la… yum!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/bill-line3-536c6863.m4a",
     "s": 4.89
    },
    "You lead, and I'll follow!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/bill-cheer1-4e43ffd8.m4a",
     "s": 1.99
    },
    "No rush. I'm not in a hurry either.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/bill-cheer2-3d798758.m4a",
     "s": 2.45
    },
    "I can smell a coconut! But I'm scared to go alone. Will you come?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-bill-coconut-5046328d.m4a",
     "s": 5.26
    },
    "My tummy's rumbling! Can you find a nut?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-bill-nut-a13d25ff.m4a",
     "s": 3.1
    },
    "Dinner's nearly ready. Can you bring the berries?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-bill-berries-1151d9c9.m4a",
     "s": 2.82
    },
    "Mmm, a strawberry! Where is it hiding?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-bill-strawberry-f7cd0e81.m4a",
     "s": 3.89
    }
   },
   "mazu": {
    "Hi, I'm Mazu! I know almost everything about dinosaurs.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/mazu-hello-c6f363af.m4a",
     "s": 4.42
    },
    "I write down everything Giganto does in my Gigantopedia.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/mazu-line1-1df8af60.m4a",
     "s": 4
    },
    "I was named after a comet. Isn't that nice?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/mazu-line2-e3c14301.m4a",
     "s": 3.08
    },
    "My tail is a club. But I only use it to crack nuts!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/mazu-line3-f3c94406.m4a",
     "s": 3.88
    },
    "First we look, then we draw. That's what scientists do!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/mazu-cheer1-42e08456.m4a",
     "s": 4.18
    },
    "Take your time. I think for ages about my inventions too.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/mazu-cheer2-3b8f75df.m4a",
     "s": 3.98
    },
    "I think this stone fell from the sky! I have to study it.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-mazu-stone-6465b179.m4a",
     "s": 3.85
    },
    "My coco-phone is almost ready. It just needs a coconut!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-mazu-coconut-ab24ce2c.m4a",
     "s": 3.74
    },
    "I don't have a shell like this yet! Will you help?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-mazu-shell-14aeb36c.m4a",
     "s": 3
    },
    "Seeds on the outside? I have to study that!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-mazu-strawberry-72cc8e8b.m4a",
     "s": 3.22
    }
   },
   "giganto": {
    "ROOOAR! …Hello.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/giganto-hello-fba8abe2.m4a",
     "s": 2.33
    },
    "Stomp. Stomp. STOMP!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/giganto-line1-c4eea9de.m4a",
     "s": 2.93
    },
    "Mrrr… I like you.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/giganto-line2-d30632cf.m4a",
     "s": 2.43
    },
    "Yaaawn… Lots of stomping today.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/giganto-line3-0e0ed2a7.m4a",
     "s": 3.25
    },
    "Mrrr… Nice drawing.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/giganto-cheer1-0518f3d1.m4a",
     "s": 2.42
    },
    "ROOOAR! …Sorry. Just happy.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/giganto-cheer2-23884ae6.m4a",
     "s": 3.71
    },
    "Grrr… Amber? Please.": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/ask-giganto-amber-a8c5e388.m4a",
