     "s": 4.17
    },
    "Mazu studies shiny stones. This one might have fallen from the sky!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-mazu-stone-04641c90.m4a",
     "s": 4.62
    },
    "Mazu is making a phone out of a coconut. She just needs the coconut!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-mazu-coconut-3070b3b7.m4a",
     "s": 4.87
    },
    "Mazu collects shells. She doesn't have this one yet!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-mazu-shell-b8d305e2.m4a",
     "s": 3.58
    },
    "Rocky wants to break a record. He's after the biggest nut in the jungle!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-rocky-nut-2de8a6a3.m4a",
     "s": 4.8
    },
    "Rocky wants to give his friends a flower. First he has to find one!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-rocky-flower-a3ebfcdf.m4a",
     "s": 4.35
    },
    "Rocky wants to give Giganto a present. How about a shiny stone?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-rocky-stone-a1fa362f.m4a",
     "s": 4.53
    },
    "Tiny's paintbrush fell apart. She can make a new one from a feather!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-tiny-feather-3916c04a.m4a",
     "s": 4.47
    },
    "Rocky wants to fly like a bird. A feather will do for a start!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-rocky-feather-70b77244.m4a",
     "s": 4.32
    },
    "Bill can smell something sweet. It smells like a strawberry!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-bill-strawberry-97f6edb2.m4a",
     "s": 4.08
    },
    "Mazu wants to find out why a strawberry wears its seeds outside!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-mazu-strawberry-35c993da.m4a",
     "s": 4.25
    },
    "Giganto is looking for amber. A tiny leaf sleeps inside it!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-giganto-amber-7fd2d225.m4a",
     "s": 4.82
    },
    "The giga flower hardly ever blooms. Giganto wants to smell it!": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-giganto-gigaflower-b9dab9d8.m4a",
     "s": 4.87
    },
    "Something sparkles in Giganto's cave. Could it be a crystal?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-giganto-crystal-7d31ce87.m4a",
     "s": 4.38
    },
    "Giganto is waiting for a treasure. Shall we look?": {
     "src": "assets/audio/voice/en/card-giganto-treasure-340f475f.m4a",
     "s": 3.35
    },
    "Bill can smell a coconut. Let's find it together!": {
